                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td style="font-size: 0px;
                      padding: 10px 25px;
                      padding-bottom: 32px;
                      word-break: break-word;" align="left">
                    <div style="font-family: Source Sans Pro, Arial;
                        font-size: 18px;
                        line-height: 1.6;
                        text-align: left;
                        color: #333333;">
                      <p>Hello {{firstName}},<br><br>
                        we're glad you're here – welcome to the <b>MINTvernetzt Community</b>!</p>
                      <p>Here you can connect with other STEM actors, find ideas for your work, and make your own projects and offerings visible.</p>
                      <p><b>Find suitable contacts</b><br>Search for actors and organizations – for example by topics, skills, or locations – and find people you can exchange ideas with.</p>
                      <p><b>Discover events</b><br>Find exciting events from the STEM community. You can also create and manage your own events.</p>
                      <p><b>Get inspired and showcase your work</b><br>Discover projects from other STEM actors and share your own. This way, others can learn from your experiences – and your work becomes more visible.</p>
                      <p><b>Find suitable funding opportunities</b><br>With the MINTvernetzt funding search, you can find funding programs from various funding databases bundled in one place.</p>
                      <p><b>Support for your public relations</b><br>In the STEM media database, you can find free images and graphics. With the MINT Sharepic Generator, you can also easily create graphics for your public relations.</p>
                      <p><b>Our tip for getting started</b><br>Take a few minutes to complete your profile. This way, others can see what you do, what you are looking for, and what you contribute to the community. It makes it easier to find suitable contacts and points of connection.</p>
                      <p><b><a href="{{url}}">Discover the MINTvernetzt Community</a></b></p><br />
                      <p>Do you have a question? You can find many answers in the help section. Or just write to us at <a
                        href="mailto:{{supportMail}}">{{supportMail}}</a>. We are happy to help you.</p>
                      <p>Best regards<br><a href="{{supportContact.url}}">{{supportContact.firstName}}</a>
                        from the MINTvernetzt team</p>
